  "_comment": "Source of truth for the Ryoko Owari cel-shaded trailer. Shots are anchored to measured vocal onsets in game/audio/bgm/opening_op.mp3 (see docs/op-timing/op_timing.json). build_trailer.py derives each shot's on-screen length from consecutive 'start' values; the final shot ends at config.duration. Techniques: 'procedural' (Ken Burns / parallax over an existing still), 'handdrawn_cel' (my generated cel keyframes, machine-inbetweened), 'ai_video' (a clip rendered by scripts/generate_video_clip.py into trailer/clips/<id>.mp4; falls back to procedural on the first frame if the clip is absent).",
